# CON-262 implementation lane scope (issue #262): capability-based Connection
# resolution per ADR TBD (PR #485). Organization-scoped CapabilityAssignments
# plus ExternalEntityMappings, lazy-on-first-use central resolver with frozen
# Execution metadata, thin identity Adapters (Graph direct, Google direct, AD
# via NinjaOne Transport), one Employee Onboarding proving Saga, operator
# routes plus readiness reporting. No new Cloudflare primitive (one more
# Workflow binding on the earned primitive); no authz model change (existing
# caller/admin posture reused).
